{"id":"chatcmpl-c08de856-5195-4104-9ac7-283c2be50687","object":"chat.completion","created":1795248425,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task succeeds by combining an expert visual description with an independent spatial grounding check, then resolving laterality using image orientation conventions and side markers. The key insight is that textual expert output alone is insufficient for left/right decisions; grounded coordinates plus marker-based reasoning provide a cross-check. The pattern generalizes to any visual QA task where laterality or spatial attribution must be verified.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When a question hinges on spatial laterality (left/right, above/below), always cross-check the expert's textual claim against an independent grounded localization before answering.\",\n    \"Use image orientation conventions (e.g., radiological convention where image-left = patient-right) plus explicit side markers to translate pixel coordinates into patient-side labels.\",\n    \"Decompose visual QA into two complementary evidence streams: semantic description (what/where in words) and coordinate grounding (where in pixels), then reconcile them.\",\n    \"When options differ only by a single attribute (e.g., side), explicitly state the discriminating evidence and the reasoning chain that selects one option over the other.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging QA\": \"Rely on standard viewing conventions and anatomical markers to map image coordinates to patient sides; never infer laterality from text alone.\",\n    \"Spatial visual question answering\": \"Pair a descriptive tool with a localization/grounding tool; use coordinate ranges to confirm or refute the description's spatial claims.\",\n    \"Multiple-choice discrimination tasks\": \"Identify the single differentiating attribute between options and gather targeted evidence specifically for that attribute.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm the image orientation convention and locate any side/orientation markers before assigning left/right.\",\n    \"Verify that the grounded coordinate region matches the expert's described location and that both agree with the chosen option.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":450,"total_tokens":832,"completion_tokens":382,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":450},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":382}}}